projectDescription:
Use Cases:


DAO founders can accept sessions bookings using the token-gated free booking mode with DAO members;


A freelance English teacher from Poland can sell sessions for 50 USDC per 30 mins to his/her students;


A celebrity/influencer can sell sessions for 500 USD per 6 minutes to his/her followers;


Social token issuers can accept sessions bookings using paid sessions mode with specified tokens.
